  m_Name: Worker's Journal 3.2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNode
  line: 'There is Peace, joy, and Ham

    The great Hammy gift is here for all

    From far and wide, children join the Family

    With Ham there is no disease

    With Ham there is no War

    With Ham there is no greed

    With Ham there are no Monsters

    Only the Hamily

    Thank you Hemlin Homlin for your Marvelous Ham'
